{% doc %}
  Item pickers of a editor bundle (component of ob-bundle): an empty panel that ob-bundle.js fills for the chosen bar,
  in the bundle's picker mode:
    swatches - per item: colour photo swatches (menu when many colours) + size menu (Rows / Cards designs);
    rows     - per item: "#1" + size menu + colour menu with photo (Boxed design);
    tiles    - colour mixes of the bar, one photo tile per item opening a sheet (size buttons, colour swatches,
               apply to all); one-item bars show size buttons and swatches inline (Pack design).
  The panel sits under the chosen bar (layouts list, compact) or under all the bars (columns, grid, pills).
  @param {string} bid - Block id.
  @param {product} product - Product.
  @param {number} color_idx - Index of the colour option (-1 = none).
  @param {number} size_idx - Index of the size option (-1 = none).
{% enddoc %}
<div class="ob__panel" data-ob-panel></div>
<dialog class="ob__dialog ob__sheet" data-ob-sheet aria-label="Customize">
  <button type="button" class="ob__x" data-ob-close aria-label="Close">×</button>
  <div class="ob__sheet-gal" data-ob-sgal></div>
  <div class="ob__sheet-body" data-ob-sbody></div>
</dialog>
